WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.180
12% APY. Sounds great.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.367
But what are you actually

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.235
being paid to risk?

00:00:06.535 --> 00:00:08.610
On-chain, there's no help desk.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.105
No chargebacks.

00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:11.670
No margin calls.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.150
Just the process you follow.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.526
The On-Chain Operator Program takes

00:00:16.526 --> 00:00:17.968
you from zero to running

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:19.813
your crypto with the discipline

00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:20.390
of a bank.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.610
107 lessons.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.325
30 strategy playbooks.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:27.285
And zero promised returns.

00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:28.365
Just a process.

00:00:29.665 --> 00:00:30.501
Apply to join,

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:31.170
at the link.
